+- **Measured Performance:** Tested on star cluster formation simulation [S1, unofficial]. First level: 44,332 cells, 10,456 triangles, 2.30 seconds. Multiple levels: 303,759 cells, 77,029 triangles, 7.73 seconds [S1, unofficial].
